  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder with imagenet_vit_l image encoder and weighted fusion achieves high accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with resnet50 while keeping other components (scvi_n200 RNA, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) consistent, to determine if the image encoder choice is critical. This balances exploitation of the current top-performing setup with exploration of alternative image encoders, which could reveal if resnet50 offers better performance for this task."
